---
description: Private vernacular for this repo — naming, files, visibility.
alwaysApply: true
---

Vernacular (kleosr V2)

Machine fields (reference; Bash hooks do not enforce):
file_name_pattern: pack_native
allowed_path_prefixes: hooks/, skills/, docs/, user-rules/, project-rules/, config/, state/, .cursor/
forbidden_class_suffixes: UseCase, Repository, Interactor, Presenter, Controller
class_pattern: PascalCase
function_pattern: snake_case
boolean_prefixes: is, has, can, should
constant_pattern: SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE
no_prose_comments: true

Topology
- Shape: single pack (rules + Bash hooks + skills + config + docs)
- Pack tooling is Bash-only (hooks scripts). No Rust. No pack Python.
- Obsidian vault = durable memory (MCP user-obsidian).

File names
- Default: snake_case or kebab-case + extension
- Hooks: snake_case.sh
- React components: PascalCase basename for tsx/jsx/vue/svelte OK

Forbidden
- Prose comments in application code
- Foreign UseCase folder theater
- Rust kleos-gate or pack Python
